        "content": "<p>The following works but i don't get which deriving handler is used - the documentation at <a href=\"https://lean-lang.org/doc/reference/latest/Type-Classes/Deriving-Instances/#--tech-term-deriving\">https://lean-lang.org/doc/reference/latest/Type-Classes/Deriving-Instances/#--tech-term-deriving</a> suggests to me this shouldn't even work since <code>isGood</code> isn't one of <code>BEq, DecidableEq</code>...</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bla</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myterm</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te2</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is there a way to make the following conditional <code>deriving</code> work?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bla</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myterm</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Te</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">isGood</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
